{"reviews":[{"id":"B01LZY0HO3-0","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"worked perfectly on my dogs' butt dreadlocks.","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2016"},{"id":"B01LZY0HO3-1","r":5.0,"t":"will be perfect. Love the feature of double side with different ...","x":"Little large to use on my Maine Coon Kittens, but when they are adult size, will be perfect. Love the feature of double side with different bristles. Kittens are getting use to brushing with the soft size so if they happen to get the matts in their hair..the wire side will be accepted.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2017"},{"id":"B01LZY0HO3-2","r":5.0,"t":"Great brush!","x":"Very good brush.  My pup was not a fan of the slicker brush I had so i needed something with the soft bristles.  Soft side... SUPER soft!  This is a heavy duty brush (she is a biter right now), soft enough so I can quickly brush her as she squirms without  poking and hurting her.  I also used it on a short haired dog and the coat was smooth and very soft and silky after. I did look at several brushes first and this seemed to be of better quality, the side with the metal bristles are closer toget","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2017"},{"id":"B01LZY0HO3-3","r":5.0,"t":"My cat loves this brush. She gets so excited ...","x":"My cat loves this brush. She gets so excited when she sees me pick it up and know that it is time to be brushed. The bristled side is soft and catches fur fairly well. The metal side really gets the excess fur out, but be careful because it will stick to larger fur-matting if you have a longhair and you don't want to hurt your fur baby.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2017"},{"id":"B01LZY0HO3-4","r":5.0,"t":"Cat Loves It and So Do I","x":"My cat asked me to write this:  &#34;Please use this on me more. I love it. Thanks!&#34; :3  It's a perfectly adequate grooming brush, what else can I say? Five stars for sturdiness and quality bristles that don't catch on fur (i.e. there are no burrs in the tines). Only grip is that I didn't get to choose a color.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2016"},{"id":"B01LZY0HO3-5","r":5.0,"t":"Excellent brush for my Cats!","x":"Great quality brush. I have two cats and one of them sheds hair like no other. This brush does a great job of getting off dead hair and dandruff. The soft bristle side really calms and relaxes both of my cats, they love it! Overall very pleased with this product and the customer service was wonderful. 5 stars!!!","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2016"},{"id":"B01LZY0HO3-6","r":5.0,"t":"My cat loves this brush","x":"i use this brush to brush a long-haired cat. This cat loves being brushed. He loves the bristle side. I like the pin side because it gently gets out tangles","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2017"},{"id":"B01LZY0HO3-7","r":5.0,"t":"Great brush!!","x":"Great brush!! I had another similar, but this one really gets the undercoat out! And my one dog who growls when brushed, actually lines up to be brushed.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2016"},{"id":"B01LZY0HO3-8","r":2.0,"t":"Good for general grooming","x":"I have a White Shepherd and I actually don't see much efficacy from the pointy side. I've stopped using that side now at this point. Alternative products are much better.  The brush is good for overall cleanup though. For knocking off loose hair when your done.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"May 2017"},{"id":"B01LZY0HO3-9","r":5.0,"t":"Best of both worlds","x":"Best of both worlds!  My dog loves the softness.  I'm able to brush and detangle at the same side of course she doesn't like to be detangled but I'm able to switch to the softer side when she gets annoyed!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2017"},{"id":"B01LZY0HO3-10","r":1.0,"t":"Was expecting something better for this price","x":"Plastic bristles are too soft to be effective in removing loose outer hair.  Was expecting something better for this price.  Was thinking of returning it but I will have to pay for return shipping, so will probably use the soft bristles as a shoe brush instead.  Would definitely NOT recommend this inferior product.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2017"},{"id":"B01LZY0HO3-11","r":1.0,"t":"Worthless! Whoever said their pet that hates brushing normally ...","x":"Worthless!  Whoever said their pet that hates brushing normally but loves this must have a poodle that literally does not shed.  It lifts NOTHING off.  Yeah, she doesn't mind it as much as a slicker brush because IT'S NOT DOING ANYTHING.  Save your money.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2017"},{"id":"B01LZY0HO3-12","r":5.0,"t":"Top quality brush!","x":"I honestly didn't even expect for this brush to be so great! I definitely recommend it! It is a good size, great quality and works like a charm! I.ll be buying more products from this brand. Thank you alot!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2017"},{"id":"B01LZY0HO3-13","r":5.0,"t":"Great Brush!","x":"This is a great brush! My dog doesn't mind me brushing him...amazing!!  I like having the 2 sides on the brush depending on my dogs brushing needs.  I highly recommend this product.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2017"},{"id":"B01LZY0HO3-14","r":5.0,"t":"is helping detangle my long haired cats terrible matted fur","x":"Works well, is helping detangle my long haired cats terrible matted fur. Does what it says it does, cat doesnt complain, plus its 2 brushes for the price of one","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2017"},{"id":"B01LZY0HO3-15","r":1.0,"t":"Bristles Nylon and too soft.","x":"Bristles are nylon and too soft, not to mention smashed together because of the packaging.  Will not even remove any hair from my Lab pup.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2018"},{"id":"B01LZY0HO3-16","r":5.0,"t":"I like the multifunctional capacity of the two sided brush","x":"I like the multifunctional capacity of the two sided brush.  My doggie, Bella, loves to get her coat brushed with her new brush.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2016"},{"id":"B01LZY0HO3-17","r":5.0,"t":"Good pet brush.","x":"Good quality pet brush. I am currently using it for longer hair cats. The wire side does a great job of removing matted hair.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2017"},{"id":"B01LZY0HO3-18","r":5.0,"t":"Best Brush","x":"This brush is perfect for my main coon cat, easy to use with grip handle. Arrived on time, package appropriately. Thank you","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2017"},{"id":"B01LZY0HO3-19","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"This is a great dual function brush!  It is very sturdy and worth the money!  My Pomeranian loves it!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2017"},{"id":"B01LZY0HO3-20","r":5.0,"t":"The dog gets pretty upset when I try to brush him","x":"It works well. The dog gets pretty upset when I try to brush him. But nothing can be done about that","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2017"},{"id":"B01LZY0HO3-21","r":5.0,"t":"Brush","x":"My dog Is still a puppy but so far we like the brush and the puppy doesn't seem to Mind it !!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2017"},{"id":"B01LZY0HO3-22","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"This product works great for my long hair cat and short hair cat...they love it too!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2017"},{"id":"B01LZY0HO3-23","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"Great brush! We have a greyhound and soft bristles are good for her.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2017"},{"id":"B01LZY0HO3-24","r":4.0,"t":"Nice brush.","x":"Came on time. Nice brush...a little bit large for my young puppies.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2017"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers say their pets love this brush, especially the soft bristle side, and some pets get excited or line up to be brushed.","cites":[4,5,6,7,8,10,14]},{"text":"Reviewers frequently praise the two-sided design with soft bristles on one side and metal pins on the other, calling it 'best of both worlds' and good value.","cites":[2,7,10,14,15]},{"text":"Several reviewers report the brush effectively removes loose hair, undercoat, dandruff, and tangles, including on long-haired and matted cats.","cites":[4,6,7,8,15]},{"text":"A few negative reviewers say the bristles are too soft or the pin side ineffective, claiming it lifts little to no hair.","cites":[9,11,12]},{"text":"Some reviewers note the brush is large or heavy-duty, which works well for adult pets but may be too big for small kittens.","cites":[2,3]}]},"qa":[]}